{
  "name": "ninja-1p",
  "id": "2026-09-19-212231442-a-top-down-blue-ninja-in-a-moonl-MkrhM9",
  "players": 1,
  "type": "ninja",
  "spec": {
    "title": "MOON NINJA",
    "oneLiner": "Dash through a moonlit bamboo garden, gather ten golden scrolls, and outwit the beetle patrols.",
    "genre": "top-down collection action",
    "mechanics": [
      "The ninja moves smoothly in four directions with the d-pad; movement is acceleration-free and stops cleanly when released.",
      "Press A to dash for 0.22 seconds in the current movement direction, or the last faced direction while standing; the ninja moves about 2.5 times normal speed and is invulnerable during the dash, with a 1.2-second cooldown shown by a small blue icon.",
      "Ten scrolls are placed across the garden; touching a scroll collects it once, adds 100 points, flashes a gold burst, and updates the HUD counter.",
      "Three beetles patrol closed routes with bounded speeds, reversing at route ends and pausing briefly at corners; later waves add crossing routes but never more than four beetles at once.",
      "A beetle contact outside a dash costs one life, flashes the ninja, knocks the ninja back, and grants 1.5 seconds of damage protection; the beetle resumes its route after the collision.",
      "The opening 8 seconds contain two slow beetles and nearby scrolls as a safe tutorial; pressure increases after four and seven scrolls, while a short low-threat recovery follows each life loss.",
      "Collecting all ten scrolls wins the round with a clear completion fanfare; the garden resets for a new round with the score retained only by the cabinet results system.",
      "A precise dash through a narrow gap to collect a scroll before a patrol turns is the main skillful risk: successful dash collection awards an additional 50-point speed bonus once per scroll.",
      "The fixed camera shows the complete garden, with bamboo clusters framing the edges and open lanes ensuring every scroll and patrol route is visible before the player commits."
    ],
    "artDirection": "256x224 single-screen arena with a deep navy moonlit garden, layered bamboo silhouettes, pale moon glow, and dark pathways that keep hazards readable. The blue ninja is about 18x22 pixels, with a distinct hooded silhouette, bright blue body, pale face slit, and gold belt; use idle, four-direction walk, dash ability-pose, item-pose, and death-pose assets. Golden scrolls are 8x10 bright yellow pickups with a red seal. Beetles are 14x12 dark red-brown shapes with contrasting shells and bright eyes, patrolling along visibly marked routes. Keep the HUD in the top strip, leave recovery spaces around scrolls, and use a brief blue trail for dashes and a gold burst for collection.",
    "referenceIntent": {
      "reference": "",
      "preserve": [],
      "change": []
    },
    "controls": {
      "left": "Walk/facing left while held",
      "right": "Walk/facing right while held",
      "up": "Walk/facing up while held",
      "down": "Walk/facing down while held",
      "a": "Dash in the current or last faced direction when cooldown is ready",
      "b": null
    },
    "palette": "arcade",
    "lose": "Lose a life on unprotected beetle contact; the game ends after all three lives are lost.",
    "scoring": "100 points per scroll, plus a one-time 50-point bonus when that scroll is collected during a dash.",
